    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S231SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S231PL0009",
      "ID_STRING": "DESC_TXT",
      "TEXT": "In his youth, this mighty lord once stood fast against an army from hell and single-handedly defeated them by sealing the gateway that spew them. He then became sovereign of his realm.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S231SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S231PL000a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Xhmaah",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S231SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S231PL000a",
      "ID_STRING": "DESC_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Every child trembles at the hearing of this most infamous name. This lord of hell is known for her blood thirsts. It is said that she once ate 1000 slaves at a banquet given by Bethrezen for a victory against the kingdom of light.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S231SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S231PL000b",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Draashel",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S231SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S231PL000b",
      "ID_STRING": "DESC_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Known in her times as the mightiest of all adepts of the black art, this lord was slain by the inquisitor Vorgel who ended her reign of terror. She is now resurrected as an undead with the intention to subjugate every mortal to her will.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
