      "TEXT": "Empire Win",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S231SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S231EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Vampire\u0027s Tower",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S231SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S231EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022The pervasive stench of death surrounds this area, Milord... No doubt a vampire inhabits the area!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S231SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S231EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Disable Vampire Tower",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S231SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S231EV0004",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Empire Intro",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S231SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S231EV0004",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Pegasus Knight \n\u0022In the name of the Highfather! We are to convert these lands, and rid them of the barbaric tribes which sully them.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S231SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S231EV0004",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Pegasus Knight \n\u0022The Barbaric Sthlanken tribespeople inhabit a few of these islands, living in sin side-by-side with the monstrous Lizard people. We must show them the true path, without mercy!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S231SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S231EV0005",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Dragon Crypt",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S231SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S231EV0005",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022It is said that the Elves worship a fallen Dragon, and that many treasures lie inside its crypt. Should we investigate, Milord?\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S231SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S231EV0006",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Griffin Nesting Spot",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S231SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S231EV0006",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022We should be careful... This is a Griffin nesting area, they tend to be very aggressive when protecting their nests. The Elves will surely forbid us from entering the nesting tower.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S231SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S231EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Legions Intro",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S231SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S231EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
